# Every song, through the game's own song-start routines (song:, event-log
# runs only; SDLBackend_DebugControl.cpp's FeedSong). From the bar, where the
# one music buffer holds MECHBAR, DEATH and LAUNCH: those three first, then
# MECH and VICTORY, which overwrite the buffer, so keep this order. Each plays
# for about 36 s of test-clock time (idle:60000 is about 18 s on this screen).
Return Return @snap:hub
Down Down Down Down @snap:bar_sel
Return @snap:bar
song:bar idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_bar
song:death idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_death
song:launch idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_launch
song:mech idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_mech
song:victory idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_victory
